From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:09:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] DVDInputStreamBluray: let libbluray pick the profile for 3D
 discs

Kodi preset player profile 6 for every disc before open. That stops
libbluray's per-disc 3D setup, so 3D discs see a non-3D player and refuse
to play.
---
 .../DVDInputStreams/DVDInputStreamBluray.cpp  | 66 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 66 insertions(+)

diff --git a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDInputStreams/DVDInputStreamBluray.cpp b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDInputStreams/DVDInputStreamBluray.cpp
